  "summary_en": "Master's thesis in Science, Technology, and Society examining the da Vinci surgical robot through content analysis of marketing materials, interviews at one hospital, and observation of a dinner-lecture. It examines body discipline, workplace power, and biomedicalization, and questions whether limited benefits justify high costs.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
